msgstr "单格环岛"

msgctxt "2026960B-123006AA-6A477E00"
msgid ""
"For building Alternate Style Road Viaducts and Street Viaducts\n"
"\n"
"Only designed for short crossings over orthogonal networks.  No diagonal support.\n"
