msgstr "用于建造轻轨/有轨电车的地面高架铁路延伸段的拼块。"

msgctxt "2026960B-123007BB-6A47B10F"
msgid "Ground Light Rail (Tram)"
msgstr "地面轻轨(有轨电车)"

msgctxt "2026960B-123006AA-6A47B3FF"
msgid ""
"Starter Pieces to build a ground level extension of the Elevated Rail network for Light Rail/Trams.\n"
"\n"
"Connect the Elevated Rail network with the Starter Piece. The Elevated Rail will turn into a Ground Light Rail track."
msgstr ""
