msgctxt "2026960B-6A231EA4-0BF0384D"
msgid "To me, pavement is a wonderful thing - the hard smooth surface, the extreme heat on a summers day. If the default highways are not suitable anymore to carry the traffic, you might consider the <a href=\"#link_id#game.tool_plop_network(network_tool_types.DIRT_ROAD)\">RHW</a> as an alternative."
msgstr "对我来说，路面是一件美妙的东西——坚硬平滑的地面，夏日里的酷热。如果默认高速公路不再适合承载交通，你可以考虑将 <a href=\"#link_id#game.tool_plop_network(network_tool_types.DIRT_ROAD)\">RHW</a> 作为替代方案。"

